1
00:00:00,341 --> 00:00:03,041
(Howard:)is going out of our way
to criticize each other.

2
00:00:03,044 --> 00:00:06,344
(Howard:)Although, there are ways
to improve our communication.

3
00:00:06,347 --> 00:00:09,217
(Howard:)One thing I learned when
I was in couples therapy was...

4
00:00:09,217 --> 00:00:10,347
(Bernadette:)Who were you

5
00:00:10,351 --> 00:00:11,521
(Bernadette:)in couples therapy with?

6
00:00:11,519 --> 00:00:13,689
(Howard:)Not important.

7
00:00:13,688 --> 00:00:16,058
(Bernadette:)Was it your mom?

8
00:00:16,057 --> 00:00:17,527
(Howard:)Not important.

9
00:00:17,525 --> 00:00:20,255
(Bernadette:)It was your mom.

10
00:00:20,261 --> 00:00:23,231
(Howard:)Anyway, the therapist had us
tell each other

11
00:00:23,231 --> 00:00:26,101
(Howard:)what we loved about one another.

12
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,770
Oh, that's so sweet!

13
00:00:27,769 --> 00:00:29,369
(Bernadette:)I want to do that.

14
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:30,770
(Amy:)All right.

15
00:00:30,772 --> 00:00:32,702
(Bernadette:)Okay, um...

16
00:00:32,707 --> 00:00:35,707
(Bernadette:)I love that you make me laugh.

17
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:37,410
(Leonard:)Thank you.

18
00:00:37,412 --> 00:00:42,252
(Howard:)And I love that you're strong
and independent.

19
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:45,380
(Bernadette:)And yet, I still love
when you hold a door for me.

20
00:00:45,386 --> 00:00:49,256
(Howard:)I love that I'm kind of a slob
around here, and...

21
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:51,327
(laughing):
you're okay with that.

22
00:00:54,228 --> 00:00:56,298
(Bernadette:)Uh-huh.

23
00:00:57,899 --> 00:01:00,769
(Bernadette:)And I love that I work
and do all the cleaning,

